SUMMARY:Otraku v1.13.1
DESCRIPTION:Otraku 1.13.1 | Otraku-v.1.13.1-ios17+\n\n- Added localizations
  support.\n- Added Turkish localization (thanks @kyoyacchi).\n- Unfinished
  messages are persisted in storage\, so mistakenly closing the sheet won't
  cause you to loose your progress (thanks @0-BlackSpectrum-0).\n- Added pr
 ogress and repeats info to the following tab in the media page. (thanks @0
 -BlackSpectrum-0).\n- Added "Watchable On"/"Readable On" filter in discove
 r filters for anime/manga.\n- Added support for underline formatting.\n- A
 dded support for the "Same Universe" media relation.\n- Made all markdown 
 content selectable: activities\, replies\, threads\, comments\, user/chara
 cter/staff bios\, reviews and media descriptions.\n- Expanded images now h
 ave a menu with buttons to download the image or share it (thanks @0-Black
 Spectrum-0).\n- The copy button in the link sheet was replaced by a share 
 button.\n- Fixed the last item in the collection list sheet being cut off.
 \n- Fixed incorrect marker clipping of unread notifications (thanks @0-Bla
 ckSpectrum-0).\n- Fixed markdown not being rendered in list notes.\n- Fixe
 d the back button briefly appearing on some tabs of the home page.
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/otraku.json
